  "notes_for_editor": "The 1941 build year rests on the register and firelookout.com; no second source confirms it. A web search linked a 1941 structure on the same forest (High Ridge), which may be the source of the date; unverified. The likely dating source is the 2002 Umatilla National Forest fire lookout eligibility study (Oregon digital collections record 275450); the cached page had no matching text, so the study itself is unread. No staffing, fires, or removal date found. Record kind remains unknown.",
